{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_019min_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_019min_4001_019min", "source_sha256": "eeaef56792586fe3203038b16a3ad0386fe16aaa153a270b5d8c1d1ad68ad41d", "ja": "{$P$}さん！\nいよいよ明日は、スタジオ入りですね。", "zh": "{$P$}先生！\n明天终于要进摄影棚了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_019min_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_019min_4002_019min", "source_sha256": "1df4fb96ff1198a61d3c7ff6aa416eb496b7bb91c4973369ebe9ea57e9b226b2", "ja": "私、これからお世話になるドラマのスタッフさん達に、\n差し入れをしたいな～って思ってるんですけど。", "zh": "我想带慰劳品给剧组工作人员，\n预先感谢他们今后的关照～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_019min_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_019min_4003_019min", "source_sha256": "3541019b50f9d6311c206141254fed7b28afc5115aadaa651226b5a4826cd4df", "ja": "でも、何を持っていったらいいのかなって……。\n{$P$}さん、アイディアありますか？", "zh": "可是，我不晓得该带什么去比较好……\n{$P$}先生有什么建议吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_019min_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_019min_4004_p", "source_sha256": "ca71825d720f6b204844e8847eedacefb891ebbb01973425a88b8ffa32034bbb", "ja": "差し入れか。そうだなぁ……。", "zh": "慰劳品啊，这个嘛……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_019min_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_019min_4005", "source_sha256": "f16bb659bde4074d3c56ee57031443efbe80aec86b172467bacdcc733e990362", "ja": "佐竹飯店特製弁当", "zh": "佐竹饭店特制便当", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_019min_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_019min_4006", "source_sha256": "9b558fc6c9e6c594d06452475d17a18e9ff0de66524cb05d4d55b2e9e001e49a", "ja": "スタミナギョーザ", "zh": "精力煎饺", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_019min_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_019min_4007", "source_sha256": "f6ea325f050729528fbc567dd74daf72957f141d05ac8d35b1253b39f8181f24", "ja": "栄養補給ドリンク", "zh": "营养补给饮料", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_019min_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_019min_4100_p", "source_sha256": "ba78977e77963c621047e5e17f9e09a16437bb94a5a4bb14229595a98875c674", "ja": "だったら、佐竹飯店の特製弁当はどうかな？\nみんな、喜ぶと思うぞ。", "zh": "这样的话，准备佐竹饭店的特制便当如何？\n大家应该会喜欢喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_019min_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_019min_4101_019min", "source_sha256": "6e28f130f41b3de1d2b07775cdfe62f36e87c55eb0c434392296cfdbf50017f4", "ja": "わっほ～い！　お弁当、いいですね！　\nしっかり食べて元気出してもらわないと、ですもんね♪", "zh": "哇哦──！便当不错呢！\n毕竟得让大家吃饱肚子，拿出活力才行嘛♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_019min_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_019min_4102_019min", "source_sha256": "a27110ee6b5ac6153111d31daaca862d337269126e9570cf5da5cf4e0556f936", "ja": "うちのお弁当なら、真心も愛情もた～っぷり、ですよ♪\nねっ、{$P$}さん！", "zh": "而且我家的便当也有满～满的真心与爱心喔♪\n对吧，{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_019min_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_019min_4200_p", "source_sha256": "851bcf575f5bef40efb567f7f73539f634905e29df969e5306bebea38c073052", "ja": "みんなにスタミナがつくように、\nギョーザを差し入れるのはどうだろう？", "zh": "带能够让大家补充精力的\n煎饺当慰劳品如何？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_019min_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_019min_4201_019min", "source_sha256": "b88cd5dc00b48f86ac1edd0cbfc23862c2152d330544f01ed3fd0cefcb91aedf", "ja": "あっ、いいですね～！　\nギョーザなら手軽だし、たくさん食べられますし♪", "zh": "啊，不错呢～！\n煎饺做起来简单，也可以让大家吃很多♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_019min_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_019min_4202_019min", "source_sha256": "c94f0a03a9954894fd2c9685e81ef37d5797e00fee00ed431fc4346432681620", "ja": "じゃあ私、腕によりをかけちゃいます！\nおいしいギョーザ、作っていきますね♪", "zh": "那我就来大展身手吧！\n我会做出好吃的煎饺来招待大家的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_019min_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_019min_4203_p", "source_sha256": "39423c88cffac85d4fe304da397c869f21def6fa6a4c7802413e1976437384b9", "ja": "あ、大きさはほどほどでいいからな？", "zh": "啊，大小适中就好了喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_019min_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_019min_4300_p", "source_sha256": "ed095fad51650c362ba293883f100f38fc4e25cdc6a55e00d0f0eb70013ce012", "ja": "じゃあ、栄養補給ドリンクをたくさん買っていこうか。\n仕事中は、手軽な方が喜ばれるかもしれないし。", "zh": "那就买很多营养补给饮料带去给大家吧。\n工作中也方便饮用，大家或许会比较喜欢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_019min_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_019min_4301_019min", "source_sha256": "08b0f1e49c92d211307a74468c41bbbbab9cbda3386964760dc8565dc327f18a", "ja": "ええ～？　栄養補給ドリンクより、ボリューム満点な\nお料理の方がいいと思うんですけど……。", "zh": "咦咦～？比起营养补给饮料，\n我觉得份量十足的料理会更好呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_019min_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_019min_4302_019min", "source_sha256": "e85942ef1e2035bef38d55e4422577778a64bcfca6231d1f3688fe9f5b3a51bd", "ja": "でも、{$P$}さんが言うなら、\nその方がいいのかな？　うん、今回はそうしますねっ♪", "zh": "不过，既然{$P$}先生都这么说了，\n那饮料应该会比较好吧？嗯，这次就这么办吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
